{
  "bodyHash": "09bdcbd7e76a7884",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>水产养殖 2 <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><em>(1.14.4+)</em></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>仅支持 NeoForge（1.20.4 之前的版本仅支持 Minecraft Forge）</em></span></p>\n<p>水产养殖 2 大幅扩展了 Minecraft 的钓鱼系统，新增 30 多种鱼类可供垂钓（任何模组或原版鱼竿均可使用！），或在野外直接发现它们在水中游动<span style=\"font-size:10px\">。</span>&nbsp;此外，游戏还添加了一系列新型鱼竿，允许你装备鱼钩与诱饵以解锁更多功能。还可定制钓鱼线与浮漂，让你的鱼竿独一无二。修饰符与自定义物品可在钓具箱中使用，该工具也支持存储额外的鱼钩、诱饵、钓线与浮漂。<br>\n每种生物群系——包括模组添加的生物群系——都有独特的新鱼类，让河流、池塘和海洋中充满游动的鱼群，极大丰富你的钓鱼体验与世界风貌！捕获的鱼类可加工成鱼柳，产出数量取决于鱼类&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<em>（若启用配置选项，则依据重量计算）。</em></span>&nbsp;此外，钓鱼时还有机会获得崭新的稀有战利品！（包括传说中的海神金属工具或护甲！&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<em>（可配置）</em>)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>更多文档请参阅我们的维基页面。</em></a></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>可钓鱼类</h3>\n<p>**淡水<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/smallmouth_bass.png\" alt=\"小嘴鲈鱼\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;小嘴鲈鱼<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/bluegill.png\" alt=\"蓝鳃太阳鱼\">&nbsp;蓝鳃太阳鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/brown_trout.png\" alt=\"褐鳟\">&nbsp;褐鳟<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/carp.png\" alt=\"鲤鱼\">&nbsp;鲤鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/catfish.png\" alt=\"鲶鱼\">&nbsp;鲶鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/gar.png\" alt=\"雀鳝\">&nbsp;雀鳝<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/minnow.png\" alt=\"麦穗鱼\">&nbsp;麦穗鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/muskellunge.png\" alt=\"狗鱼\">&nbsp;狗鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/perch.png\" alt=\"河鲈\">&nbsp;河鲈</p>\n<p>**干旱<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/bayad.png\" alt=\"贝雅鱼\">&nbsp;贝雅鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/boulti.png\" alt=\"布氏鱼（尼罗罗非鱼）\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;布氏鱼（尼罗罗非鱼）<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/capitaine.png\" alt=\"卡皮坦鱼（尼罗河鲈）\">&nbsp;卡皮坦鱼（尼罗河鲈）<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/synodontis.png\" alt=\"倒游鲶\">&nbsp;倒游鲶</p>\n<p><strong>北极海洋</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_cod.png\" alt=\"大西洋鳕鱼\">&nbsp;大西洋鳕鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/blackfish.png\" alt=\"黑鱼\">&nbsp;黑鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pacific_halibut.png\" alt=\"太平洋大比目鱼\">&nbsp;太平洋大比目鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_halibut.png\" alt=\"大西洋大比目鱼\">&nbsp;大西洋大比目鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/atlantic_herring.png\" alt=\"大西洋鲱鱼\">&nbsp;大西洋鲱鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pink_salmon.png\" alt=\"粉红鲑鱼\">&nbsp;粉红鲑鱼 <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>（也在淡水中）<br></em></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/pollock.png\" alt=\"狭鳕\">&nbsp;狭鳕<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/rainbow_trout.png\" alt=\"虹鳟\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;虹鳟<br></span></p>\n<p>**咸水<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/jellyfish.png\" alt=\"水母\">&nbsp;水母<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/red_grouper.png\" alt=\"红石斑鱼\">&nbsp;红石斑鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tuna.png\" alt=\"金枪鱼\">&nbsp;金枪鱼</p>\n<p>**丛林<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/arapaima.png\" alt=\"巨骨舌鱼\">&nbsp;巨骨舌鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/arrau_turtle.png\" alt=\"亚鲁龟\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;亚鲁龟<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/piranha.png\" alt=\"食人鱼\">&nbsp;食人鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tambaqui.png\" alt=\"巨脂鲤\">&nbsp;巨脂鲤</p>\n<p>**沼泽<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/AQ2-1.18.2/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/frog.png\" alt=\"青蛙\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;青蛙 <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><em>（自 Minecraft 1.19 起移除）</em></span></span><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/leech.png\" alt=\"水蛭\">&nbsp;水蛭<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/box_turtle.png\" alt=\"箱龟\">&nbsp;箱龟<br>\n<em>及淡水鱼类</em></p>\n<p><strong>蘑菇岛</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/red_shrooma.png\" alt=\"红色蘑菇鱼\">&nbsp;红色蘑菇鱼<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/brown_shrooma.png\" alt=\"棕色蘑菇鱼\">&nbsp;棕色蘑菇鱼<br>\n<em>及淡水鱼类</em></p>\n<p>**其他战利品<br>\n**<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/driftwood.png\" alt=\"漂流木\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;漂流木<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/tin_can.png\" alt=\"铁罐头\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;铁罐头<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/goldfish.png\" alt=\"金鱼\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;金鱼<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/message_in_a_bottle.png\" alt=\"瓶中信 [右键查看信息！]\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;瓶中信 [右键查看信息！]<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/algae.png\" alt=\"藻类（淡水生物群系）\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;藻类（淡水生物群系）<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/box.png\" alt=\"箱子\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;箱子<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/lockbox.png\" alt=\"锁箱\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;锁箱<br></span><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamMetallurgy/Aquaculture/master/src/main/resources/assets/aquaculture/textures/item/treasure_chest.png\" alt=\"宝箱\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;宝箱<br></span>\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_5b8066e6-2213-4384-bd51-f1a9ebc43885.png\" alt=\"image\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;海神的馈赠</span></p>\n<h2>**合成配方</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_7cd9898d-34ac-41cf-bc0a-83f164936de2.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_f4cea8f5-8a94-4faf-ac50-545b226ca22a.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_6bc91821-7595-4bd9-ad44-d74559bb46e4.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_ae62d924-8a4d-4e23-8b04-31f06095fde7.png\" alt=\"image\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_b8273603-600f-4de3-bc49-1668e832b3f8.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<h2>**截图</h2>\n<p>**</p>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WcjgaH5.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/60028/description_010ee9bb-373a-4eae-95d2-dfc006a5ac32.png\" alt=\"image\"></strong></h2>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Pee4rVN.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>水产养殖 1&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:8px\">(1.12.2 &amp; 更早版本)</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><h2><strong>水产养殖</strong></h2><h2><strong>简介</strong></h2><p>水产养殖是对 Minecraft 基础钓鱼系统的扩展。它让你能够使用全新系列的鱼竿和工具钓起超过 30 种新鱼类。每个生物群系都有新的鱼类，带有随机权重，可加工成鱼排和食物，还能钓到闪闪发光的新型掉落物！（包括传说中的海神木工具或盔甲！）<br>&nbsp;</p><p>要开始你的水产养殖之旅，你需要制作铁、金或钻石钓鱼竿（见下文）。</p><h2><strong>可钓鱼类</strong></h2><p><strong>淡水</strong>（森林、平原、高山）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vy8Fg.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/vy8Fg.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 蓝鳃太阳鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hfmXq.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/hfmXq.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲈鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fBPF4.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/fBPF4.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 河鲈<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hf9TK.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/hf9TK.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 褐鳟<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/STo9U.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/STo9U.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲶鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hi3x8.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hi3x8.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲤鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/olH26.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/olH26.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 白斑狗鱼</p><p><strong>荒漠</strong>（沙漠）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lDQoL0K.png\">&nbsp;尼罗河鲈鱼 (Capitaine)<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I26Avrc.png\">&nbsp;尼罗罗非鱼 (Boulti)<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R5QHHFq.png\">&nbsp;鲿鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dgwY14b.png\">&nbsp;倒游鲇</p><p><strong>极地</strong>（冻原、泰加林）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4GcZL.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/4GcZL.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鳕鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9s2ltlX.png\">&nbsp;狭鳕<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qVDga8e.png\">&nbsp;鲱鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mrSz9ij.png\">&nbsp;庸鲽<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sCzdERo.png\">&nbsp;红鲑<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjDhV.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjDhV.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 虹鳟<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AV269o8.png\" width=\"17\" height=\"16\">&nbsp;黑鱼</p><p><strong>咸水</strong>（海滩、海洋）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BXImf.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/BXImf.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲑鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eFpIp.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/eFpIp.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 金枪鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rVr2e.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/rVr2e.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 红石斑鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jw13H.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jw13H.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 剑鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p489Z.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/p489Z.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲨鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9G69.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/v9G69.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 鲸鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VoalDkJ.png\">&nbsp;鱿鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QBYqKg0.png\">&nbsp;河豚<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O7O4Yhn.png\">&nbsp;水母</p><p><strong>热带</strong>（丛林）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VxAbR5Z.png\">&nbsp;巨骨舌鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZJfauHY.png\">&nbsp;食人鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZBq8t3r.png\">&nbsp;淡水白鲳<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1W9PXAS.png\"> 电鳗</p><p><strong>半咸水&nbsp;</strong>（沼泽）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g0poZkE.png\">&nbsp;青蛙<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lBdrN6N.png\">&nbsp;乌龟<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tyWN6yW.png\">&nbsp;水蛭<br><em>以及淡水鱼类</em></p><p><strong>蘑菇</strong>（蘑菇岛）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJKDC.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJKDC.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 红蘑菇鱼<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/udpV8.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/udpV8.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> 棕蘑菇鱼<br><em>以及淡水鱼类</em></p><p><strong>所有生物群系<br></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aCuEOwi.png\">&nbsp;金鱼</p><p><strong>随机掉落物<br></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b4g5G3X.png\">&nbsp;藻类（淡水生物群系）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mXcrvNX.png\">&nbsp;海藻（咸水生物群系）<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k55j8Ce.png\">&nbsp;木棍<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/muk8uoO.png\">浮木 [可合成木板！]<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vHoSvD1.png\">&nbsp;皮革靴子<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EFfLBqW.png\">&nbsp;罐头盒<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8upC4TT.png\">&nbsp;骨头<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S2meWvo.png\">&nbsp;瓶中信 [右键查看信息！]<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/czINLcQ.png\">&nbsp;箱子<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XdbpBOV.png\">&nbsp;保险箱<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Rhw4Kb.png\">&nbsp;宝箱<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qp9VJRT.png\">&nbsp;海神木宝箱 (?!?)<br><br></p><p>注：如果你使用了添加新生物群系的模组，或在没有特定鱼类的生物群系中钓鱼，系统将默认生成淡水鱼类。</p><h2><strong>合成配方</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rD02ZQ8.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d1CPhaD.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/so1cDZT.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uNoAFwR.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a1PqJ01.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LmSyklA.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HSw5Nk9.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dRYEhhO.png\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wXoxO0H.png\" width=\"456\" height=\"256\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tlqIbKH.png\"></p><h2><strong>附魔</strong></h2><p>诱鱼 - 增加渔获数量<br>磁力 - 增加掉落物数量<br>远投 - 延长抛投距离<br>近投 - 缩短抛投距离<br>双钩 - 有几率一次钓起两条鱼<br>倒刺钩 - 延长上鱼判定窗口<br>重线 - 提高钓取高重量物品的概率</p><h2><strong>截图</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hm36i.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hm36i.png\" width=\"864\" height=\"514\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBksh.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/IBksh.png\" width=\"872\" height=\"520\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a7shC.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/a7shC.png\" width=\"864\" height=\"504\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wj8ro.png\" alt=\"https://i.imgur.com/wj8ro.png\" width=\"892\" height=\"544\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qETDI